# Rocky Roads: "This land enters tapped unless you control a Mount or Vehicle" (CR 614.1d): a Mount is enough, not only a
# Vehicle. Bot1 casts a Caustic Bronco (a Snake Horse Mount creature, CR 205.3m) for {1}{B} with Mox Jet and Mox Pearl,
# then plays Rocky Roads, which enters untapped and adds {R}.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Caustic Bronco
Rocky Roads
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Caustic Bronco.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Rocky Roads.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Rocky Roads.Tapped = false
